# Dashboard (Next)

- Admin / ops **Valentia** Next.js app. Dev port **3001**.
- This is **not** the Next.js from training data — read `dashboard/node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before using Next APIs (else official docs). Skill: `nextjs-16`.
- Shares Nest API in `server/`. Dense admin UX — tables, filters, safe destructive actions (`design.md` §8).
- UI tokens from [`design.md`](../../design.md). Stack: `.cursor/rules/frontend-stack.mdc`.

## Skills

- Next/React: `nextjs-16`, `react-dev`, `react-useeffect`
- Forms / data / state / realtime: `form-validation`, `data-fetching`, `state-management`, `realtime-sockets`
- UI: `frontend-design`, **`ui-ux-pro-max`** for dense admin layouts
- API needs: `frontend-to-backend-requirements`
- Build/test: `implement`, `tdd`, `code-review`

Audit file changes under `releases/dashboard.md` (see release-logging rule).
